### ============================================================
###  Operator Invocation API — /api/operators/**
###  Any authenticated tenant member may invoke operators.
###  Run auth.http first to populate {{access_token}}.
### ============================================================

### List active operators
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operators
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Invoke an operation on the bootstrapping operator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operators/bootstrapping/invoke
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "operation": "ping",
  "parameters": {}
}

### Invoke an operation on the join-discovery operator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operators/join-discovery/invoke
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "operation": "ping",
  "parameters": {}
}

### 422 — operator that doesn't exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operators/nonexistent-operator/invoke
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "ping",
  "parameters": {}
}
